# The generator's own templates, which share this chart's templates/ directory.
#
# prow/jobs/generator.go reads these with text/template against its own data model
# ($.Config, $.ImageContext). Helm renders everything under templates/, including
# subdirectories, so without these lines it tries to evaluate 25 files as manifests and
# fails. Same situation as prow/agent-workflows, at a larger scale.
#
# Listed explicitly rather than as templates/*.tpl so that a new generator template
# directory breaks the render loudly and someone has to decide what it means.
templates/config/
templates/periodics/
templates/postsubmits/
templates/presubmits/
templates/job-config-job.yaml.tpl

# 1.9 MB, and the chart does not need it. jobs.yaml never enters the render: it exceeds the
# 1 MB ConfigMap limit, so the substitutor Job clones the repo at runtime, resolves it with
# envsubst and gzips the result into the job-config ConfigMap. Excluding it keeps 1.9 MB out
# of every manifest generation.
jobs.yaml

# Not chart inputs: the generator, its image build context, the ack-build-tools CLI and docs.
generator.go
images/
tools/
requirements.txt
README.md
